 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 President Trump boards Air Force One in South Carolina last night. Photo: Kent Nishimura/AFP via Getty Images 🌊 President Trump said last night that he would "probably pass" on renaming the Atlantic Ocean after Google CEO Sundar Pichai asked him not to do so. Google Maps and similar services have adopted Trump's rebrandings of the Gulf of Mexico ("Gulf of America") and Lake Ontario ("Lake America") for U.S. users. Go deeper . 👩‍⚖️ A federal judge ordered President Trump to sit for a deposition in his $10 billion defamation lawsuit against the BBC over an edit of one of his speeches. Go deeper . 🔓 Governments and companies worked through the night on urgent security updates after the AI-assisted discovery of major flaws in a programming language vital to 70% of global websites. Go deeper . 
 
